WEBVTT

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.741
They sponsored a trip
to a conference in Washington.

00:15:00.765 --> 00:15:04.897
GA: It's the largest gathering
of professional Latinos in the US.

00:15:05.349 --> 00:15:09.991
I saw this one speaker and he was so good.

00:15:10.015 --> 00:15:12.222
He was so passionate, energetic.

00:15:12.246 --> 00:15:15.587
Besides being phenomenal,
he looked like me,

00:15:15.611 --> 00:15:19.075
and this was the first time
I had seen someone in person

00:15:19.099 --> 00:15:21.931
that looked like me that was a total boss.

00:15:21.955 --> 00:15:23.256
AG: At the end of the talk,

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:25.723
Gonzalo went up to the speaker
and asked for advice.

00:15:25.747 --> 00:15:28.642
GA: I asked him like,
"I want to be a CEO one day.

00:15:28.666 --> 00:15:30.688
How do I get to be like you?"